  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core Support Center for Analysis and Prevention of Corruption Moldova 2022-2025</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">K&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d Center for Analysis and Prevention of Corruption Moldova 2022-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core-support is to be provided to CAPC for 2022-2025 to develop internal capacities to manage results in accordance to internal institutional Strategy; enhance monitoring and reporting skills therefore contributing to the promotion of accountable and professional local CSOs in Moldova. 

As the main purpose of core support is to strengthen local CSOS, it is expected that by the end of the contribution CAPC&apos;s team will fully implement the core objectives stated in the institutional Strategy 2022-2025; will implement the System Based Audit Recommendations from 2020 related to internal structural and institutional changes and priorities and will address institutional weaknesses related to human resources and board functioning, financial sustainability, IT security, strategic communication and projects and activities sustainability. 

Sweden will support CAPC in its endeavour to implement the following objectives: 

- Upgraded corruption proofing, monitoring and/or assessment tools, covering civic engagement and women empowerment, capitalized in partnerships with the public and private sector;

- Gender-sensitive whistle-blower reporting, protection and victim-centered assistance in corruption cases provided;

- Strengthened CAPCs organizational, expert, financial capacities, sustainability and visibility.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Detta bidrag &#xe4;r p&#xe5; v&#xe4;g att ge ett k&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d till CAPC 2022-2025 f&#xf6;r genomf&#xf6;randet av den uppdragsdrivna institutionella CACP-strategin och RAF (Resultatbed&#xf6;mningsramverket). Organisationen kommer att f&#xe5; st&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r att genomf&#xf6;ra k&#xe4;rnaktiviteter inom omr&#xe5;det f&#xf6;r att bek&#xe4;mpa och f&#xf6;rebygga korruption men ocks&#xe5; f&#xf6;r att st&#xe4;rka interna institutionella policyer och processer f&#xf6;r en h&#xe5;llbar och motst&#xe5;ndskraftig utveckling.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This contribution is a about to grant a core support to CAPC in 2022-2025 for the implementation of the mission driven institutional CACP Strategy and RAF (Results Assessment Framework). The organisation will be supported to implement core activities in the field of combating and preventing corruption but also to strengthen internal institutional policies and processes for a sustainable and resilient development.</narrative>
  </description>
